# USUÁRIOS

### #Listar usuários
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### # Criar novo usuário
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Michael Jackson",
  "sex": "Masculino",
  "address": "Rua B, 213",
  "birthDate": "1990-04-13T15:32:00.000Z"
}



